    "body-user-available" : {
      "comment" : "Address Book notification description for an available nickname. Migrated from legacy key 97r-0l. Legacy translator context: ‘Notification bubble descriptions. These are only notifications that require localization. Many notifications just send the raw message received so they are not localized here’. Legacy translator context: ‘Address Book spoken text uses the actual notification message for that notification type. It is not defined here’.",
